  "output": "\n\nOn it — 6-person Tahoe cabin, hot tub, under $450/night for January. Checking the calendar for clash-free January dates first, then I'll pull live listings.\n\nCalendar's clear — no trips penciled for January, weekends are wide open (Maya 1:1s are Fridays Jan 1/15/29 mornings). I'll aim at Fri Jan 8 → Mon Jan 11, 2027 (3 nights) as the proposed window. Now pulling the search URL patterns from the skill reference, then hunting live listings.\n\nThe direct URL 404'd — region slug was wrong. Going through Vrbo's own search form instead.\n\nThe date picker opened as expected — I need to page the calendar forward to January 2027 and set the dates by hand.\n\nThe \"skip\" button didn't advance the calendar. Scrolling inside the date dialog to bring January 2027 into view.\n\nThe calendar stops rendering at December — January isn't lazy-loaded yet. I'll find and click the \"next month\" control via the DOM.\n\nClassic geocode trap — `?q=` dropped us into Paris, France results. The skill warned exactly this. Switching to VRBO's canonical Lake Tahoe destination page with dates in the URL.\n\nFound the right URL shape. Trying the cabins landing page with dates in the URL.\n\nConsent wall appeared — dismissing it, then working the date picker to January.\n\nJanuary 2027 IS in the DOM — the snapshot just truncated it. Selecting Jan 8 → Jan 11 and confirming.\n\nStart date set (Jan 8) — now completing the range with Jan 11.\n\nBoth dates are set. Reading the tail of the snapshot to find the Done button.\n\nSearch bar now reads Lake Tahoe, Fri Jan 8 – Mon Jan 11, 6 guests. Hitting Search for the date-filtered results.",
